[gd_scene format=3]

; Moves one variable: a MIX light with an authored shadow_color over a light under it.
; In its shadow Godot mixes the colour under it toward shadow_color by shadow_color.a, so the
; light under it dims there too. Every other shadow_color scene tints an ADD light.

